INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(1311,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC1717638','Where should paediatric surgery be performed?','Arul GS, Spicer RD.','1998','adzick atwell spargo atwell spargo beynon pyloromyotomy crombleholme alton cendron alman klauber heilman danjoux jenkin grimard gaspar whitton 911x mpo1 palder alton daneman 4_spec_no fortune graca haselbarth kuehler feustel barsoum klidjian herniotomy circumcision groff nagaraj pietsch meller loeff dembek adzick flake unsolved hendren lillehei nejm198807143190205 heneghan bellemare mollitt discala koeppel tepas knudson shagoury lakhoo najmaldin impalpable 410x hiura muguruma okuno horii deferens herniorrhaphy vasectomized ramstedt mcnicol mcnicol bihari raafat morland shann vyas trent persad mctavish imber mouriquand meatal circumcision 410x tb07242 pledger fahy mourik stiller lennox rajput gauderer hack adzick rickwood phimosis overdiagnosed circumcisions rickwood phimosis overdiagnosed circumcisions shann spicer 1br steeno gerven knops orchidopexies andrologia stiller centralisation stiller stoddart bingham brereton gastroschisis 1_spec_no pablot brereton pledger pledger taddio ilersich circumcision saing tb01088 tibby hatherill tiret nivoche hatton desmonts vourc walc orchiopexy cabaniss ramenofsky chell kapila circumcision kapila circumcision cuckoo 632a burge','Full Text The Full Text of this article is available as a PDF (111.1 KB). Selected References These references are in PubMed. This may not be the complete list of references from this article. Adzick N. S., Harrison M. R. Fetal surgical therapy. Lancet. 1994 Apr 9;343(8902):897–902. doi: 10.1016/s0140-6736(94)90012-4. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Atwell J. D., Spargo P. M. The provision of safe surgery for children. Arch Dis Child. 1992 Mar;67(3):345–349. doi: 10.1136/adc.67.3.345. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Atwell J. D., Spargo P. M. The provision of safe surgery for children. Arch Dis Child. 1992 Mar;67(